  "body": "With neighbouring building sites now under construction, the motivated owner is offering an even bigger price reduction to secure a sale. Don't miss this fantastic opportunity to own a brand-new family home at an attractive price!\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n*\tSpacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area downstairs, with four generously sized bedrooms upstairs, including a master bedroom with ensuite.\r\n*\tSeamless indoor-outdoor flow from the living area onto a sunny deck - perfect for summer BBQs and entertaining family and friends.\r\n*\tModern comforts include central air conditioning, a built-in sound system, quality Fisher & Paykel appliances, designer light fitting and the peace of mind of a 10-Year Master Build Warranty.\r\n*\tExcellent location with the newly opened road connecting through to Flavell Drive and Grand Drive, providing convenient access to the motorway and nearby amenities.\r\n\r\nDon't let this opportunity slip away! Secure your brand-new home in Strathmill Orewa while this exceptional opportunity lasts.",
